1068" lrx="907" lry="1100" /><zone xml:id="m-affdd509-48af-4356-b6e8-ebe01991d121" ulx="40" uly="1094" lrx="469" lry="1127" /><zone xml:id="m-d52847ec-39e0-42d8-aa26-161805c8e5e4" ulx="479" uly="1094" lrx="907" lry="1131" /><zone xml:id="m-fbc49677-f045-4b7e-abec-db809c0d5a7b" ulx="42" uly="1121" lrx="469" lry="1156" /><zone xml:id="m-4c438bc0-8cc5-4057-963b-15c699c10c03" ulx="479" uly="1121" lrx="904" lry="1157" /><zone xml:id="m-858a8b6f-b3e7-4fdd-b105-8e180f64f149" ulx="41" uly="1147" lrx="470" lry="1185" /><zone xml:id="m-f646fbb0-add5-4f1e-b5a7-fb326f73517b" ulx="481" uly="1149" lrx="907" lry="1181" /><zone xml:id="m-27f5c59a-4812-41ec-afe8-b82f95ba85ce" ulx="42" uly="1176" lrx="470" lry="1211" /><zone xml:id="m-a8cd0d08-83c4-4be7-8d68-305d120af804" ulx="478" uly="1176" lrx="905" lry="1210" /><zone xml:id="m-0ba9f26c-c80f-4450-84aa-7133db616236" ulx="43" uly="1205" lrx="469" lry="1236" /><zone xml:id="m-2ab602c0-26bd-4182-a2c8-535690319945" ulx="478" uly="1207" lrx="908" lry="1237" /><zone xml:id="m-e8fed570-44f3-428a-9cd1-54bce065a668" ulx="44" uly="1230" lrx="471" lry="1261" /><zone xml:id="m-41a02e6f-72ac-48da-aed8-9e45d1626404" ulx="476" uly="1234" lrx="907" lry="1261" /><zone xml:id="m-c6f9cf81-c6c9-4c6a-9493-176f3fb78cdd" ulx="42" uly="1256" lrx="905" lry="1295" /><zone xml:id="m-58ab51b2-b7db-430e-8a62-017e47ca2fc0" ulx="68" uly="1294" lrx="463" lry="1336" /><zone xml:id="m-7e584ad7-3fbf-4555-b63c-cf884ea23717" ulx="431" uly="1337" lrx="525" lry="1372" /><zone xml:id="m-95a397df-d5ac-4ff6-beb6-007d9607f486" ulx="94" uly="1368" lrx="908" lry="1409" /><zone xml:id="m-ccb9f1ca-d657-4189-8747-e1c80e87b934" ulx="50" uly="1396" lrx="905" lry="1435" /><zone xml:id="m-b7553450-6976-4919-b5af-52421c290688" ulx="43" uly="1426" lrx="632" lry="1459" /><zone xml:id="m-c47e5814-3c8c-43b4-97e6-280b6533edde" ulx="44" uly="1452" lrx="476" lry="1492" /><zone xml:id="m-7606a3b8-7f7c-4420-beaf-e0176b329f09" ulx="70" uly="1489" lrx="500" lry="1533" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-4222bba6-1bc5-4d92-8d58-eef0be1311b7" n="1789" facs="#m-53420766-ce88-49ad-8944-22dff360892a" /><div xml:id="m-008c4d12-f21c-4067-815d-7ca11bdf02bb">
            <lg xml:id="m-3713ba1e-47d7-42fa-998a-0d1609aa1243">
              <l xml:id="m-d8b1ab97-de88-492a-99dd-5c4d251aee7c" facs="#m-4b3809fe-f118-4b0e-ba43-9a31ae8861d6" label="ambiguous">1507</l><l xml:id="m-844e6ed0-f517-4cdc-b481-a9fe8b7eb254" facs="#m-14af44ca-20f8-4c26-92b4-f6ddbccff55c" label="ambiguous">Iuly 22.</l><l xml:id="m-55ef34f5-4e65-4da0-b2bf-fe4a51e652a7" facs="#m-108524c5-926a-402b-9c7c-cb094d081b87" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Cant. 3 et 8.</l><l xml:id="m-ca5c9e4a-cb7b-4604-a153-3376ab5a40b5" facs="#m-48b1753b-0da8-4681-bbec-f27a2bdbb11a" label="lyrics-like">NUrgam, et circuibo civitâtem; ] evigiláre faciátis diléctam donec</l><l xml:id="m-cfb3f655-4436-4610-b370-60917a8361cf" facs="#m-14759503-4ab4-420b-94a7-98a48c6c8a8b" label="lyrics-like">O per vicos et platéas quaeraml ipsã velit. Pone me ut signáculum</l><l xml:id="m-63d2270e-ac8d-4b47-a3d5-2378e29f8086" facs="#m-711b36e3-1f04-427d-b044-7484f8453647" label="lyrics-like">quem diligit ánima mea: quaesivi</l><l xml:id="m-f3de6669-aa30-4654-b718-b37982c87ca2" facs="#m-e7688013-18fc-48af-9d4b-8265efdccc85" label="lyrics-like">super cor tuum, ut signáculum</l><l xml:id="m-5f5faed5-0503-4c20-a782-3b5e171e31b6" facs="#m-904f8715-9060-4035-845d-ba4c07d8da16" label="lyrics-like">illum, et non invéni. Invenérunt super bráchium tuum: quia fortis</l><l xml:id="m-63e12c2a-d24f-45f2-a814-047b74c59a43" facs="#m-4427564a-03de-4440-b000-d1f4e0c45287" label="lyrics-like">me vígiles qui custódiunt civitátem.</l><l xml:id="m-2121b87a-5caf-45de-a08e-beecbb19f564" facs="#m-2199cd28-c351-4793-9930-ab263945318f" label="lyrics-like">est ut mors diléctio, dura sicut</l><l xml:id="m-289db6fd-9b81-4e99-8aa3-e618e0071117" facs="#m-dfbc41e0-5ba4-45ba-8cbe-6ab17ffe4103" label="lyrics-like">Num quem diligit ánima mea vidi¬</l><l xml:id="m-baf5908a-7de8-40d7-9dc2-91a0ef7b0ea3" facs="#m-2f4cbadc-461c-407f-8aa1-499212b184ec" label="lyrics-like">inférnus aemulátio : lampades ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-63d5b713-5754-48cf-8a76-2533181081b2" facs="#m-67d38b60-3852-46dc-a66d-ea8bfaea1aa6" label="lyrics-like">lámpades ignis atque flammárum.</l><l xml:id="m-df4fca92-258a-41d9-a85c-e5ddee7d2882" facs="#m-8e2de8d6-692a-47ab-b316-555e057bc5d3" label="lyrics-like">stis? Páululum cum pertransissem</l><l xml:id="m-8163471c-e114-4b4f-b8c5-5fdd9ca74ab6" facs="#m-a4f11bf3-f497-4405-b436-5b673a1aad9d" label="lyrics-like">eos, invéni quem diligit ánima</l><l xml:id="m-66e5b279-8c8f-4e59-b4a7-dc7f9f36ac94" facs="#m-25c9ef48-3f71-4357-adb6-a8c758a8dfa0" label="lyrics-like">Aquae multae non potuérunt ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-03c1079a-6d70-474b-bf32-6961e5001c60" facs="#m-39362e41-8c70-4020-b65c-78f8a890f195" label="lyrics-like">mea: ténui eum, nec dimittam,</l><l xml:id="m-bd1fb3e3-6b5f-4972-b055-7db5d1593824" facs="#m-2b6bd175-58c0-4cea-be75-854f27e14385" label="lyrics-like">stínguere caritátem, nec flúmina</l><l xml:id="m-7451c955-ba59-475a-99e4-6d3790367b4a" facs="#m-f6005850-75dd-40c4-9d74-2d82ef90881f" label="lyrics-like">donec introdúcam illum in domum</l><l xml:id="m-af17138c-1a5f-4cae-a941-84e41a037e24" facs="#m-b4d2987b-ad51-4ce8-b07b-b78f549df83b" label="lyrics-like">óbruent illam : si déderit homo</l><l xml:id="m-7de0b555-c0b9-4153-9e98-eb09d867a4c2" facs="#m-99479757-4e05-437d-9329-abff32d15c21" label="lyrics-like">matris meae, et in cubículum ge¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b648d00-f899-482f-8088-b7152fb48ed4" facs="#m-65ae0916-94d6-40ea-ac65-93c4ac0fc3d8" label="lyrics-like">omnem substántiam domus suae</l><l xml:id="m-c579c5e7-e26f-4a18-83b2-c73e32014857" facs="#m-d3028be5-4697-48fa-bcdd-9927e61100f6" label="lyrics-like">nitricis meae. Adjúro vos, filiae</l><l xml:id="m-20bccb21-1555-4144-a5a5-b81ff8875095" facs="#m-0e81830e-e19e-49c6-839d-a0a64fe98c77" label="lyrics-like">pro dilectióne, quasi nihil despiciet</l><l xml:id="m-25e694f0-6840-4b98-8285-298b931393b3" facs="#m-22d99a7a-0da0-402d-9b3d-b524394b108a" label="lyrics-like">Jerúsalem, per cápreas cervósque</l><l xml:id="m-54020779-a1fd-4133-8ba2-99d68444272e" facs="#m-fde81903-b4f8-4038-bea8-fea20f53f7e2" label="ambiguous">eam.</l><l xml:id="m-bbf8c824-2e69-40c0-b0d8-76939cf003e3" facs="#m-424aefb4-af41-4bfc-bfd5-6111156103b1" label="lyrics-like">campórum, ne suscitétis, neque</l><l xml:id="m-b6c91097-4150-45c8-9443-ff9c16258c63" facs="#m-9e05ccb0-db42-4991-b155-77f992513abb" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Dilexísti. D. 1216. Allelúia, allelúia. V. Diffúsa est. p. 1323.</l><l xml:id="m-c445779b-c5c7-4174-9459-9f847d45da6d" facs="#m-43bb68f7-6e70-4178-8aa7-e68b868f57a2" label="ambiguous">FSequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 7. f.</l><l xml:id="m-d7c37e71-da27-4167-9514-91c85532b03b" facs="#m-0b189a2d-d855-414e-a690-1ba1dc3a0996" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Rogábat Jesum leum plus diligit? Respóndens Si¬</l><l xml:id="m-55f09496-bd6c-4a88-a8da-70a559110374" facs="#m-d90a985f-8004-49e7-8070-e6a7be3d9346" label="lyrics-like">L quidam de pharisaéis, ut mandu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d2c1f6d0-ae35-4a7c-baa0-bbba46be46df" facs="#m-0938bbe2-5538-411f-8291-7565857f5b6f" label="text-like">mon, dixit: Aestimo quia is cui</l><l xml:id="m-ac35fd24-c3c0-420a-bff0-d792f71cd3af" facs="#m-7aa65e16-df3a-468f-a37c-6387ad5a7165" label="lyrics-like">plus donávit. At ille dixit ei</l><l xml:id="m-928aba39-e747-4f7e-9d67-93553c560221" facs="#m-f2f10b71-2c8f-4a2e-b138-3df26e6b02ee" label="lyrics-like">cáret cum illo. Et ingréssus domum</l><l xml:id="m-ab060880-14a5-42e8-83b6-4713521889fa" facs="#m-6260982b-0eeb-4ef1-aef8-1d82f1d0f922" label="lyrics-like">Recte judicásti. Et convérsus ad</l><l xml:id="m-effb6f16-595f-4f9b-baec-fec2681bfcfd" facs="#m-defb7bc8-2e0f-4e01-8e32-6df6873b3d18" label="lyrics-like">pharisaéi, discúbuit. Et ecce múlier,</l><l xml:id="m-07407245-ea71-48bf-ae2b-1753b4037b42" facs="#m-b135791b-3fc5-4579-87b8-32657c315a36" label="lyrics-like">mulierem, dixit Simóni: Vides</l><l xml:id="m-3f109160-7e7e-4545-a46d-658b6bf9dc4f" facs="#m-61cc830e-1114-4fcd-bed8-4388a639020d" label="lyrics-like">quae erat in civitáte peccátrix, ut</l><l xml:id="m-fa084817-dd6d-42d6-9430-419239e5f275" facs="#m-da366c8e-2d1e-4726-9b2d-dbfa95333a6f" label="lyrics-like">cognóvit quod accubuísset in domo</l><l xml:id="m-afadffa6-29cf-4d63-b1f1-d81c67c9f6aa" facs="#m-e83f0d39-531c-412e-b907-454e2136d4c7" label="lyrics-like">hanc mulierem? Intrávi in domum</l><l xml:id="m-351589df-f2fa-4051-867e-28b3371f032c" facs="#m-f54f940d-a9a0-4f81-8308-2f9a7464d456" label="lyrics-like">pharisaéi, áttulit alabastrum un¬</l><l xml:id="m-8068b746-b9a5-4482-ad33-4fe87fbdb615" facs="#m-9f4f7082-3cbf-4ba3-aaad-c8f24925c9aa" label="lyrics-like">tuam, aquam pédibus meis non de¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed321ebb-784b-4422-82bf-6a6b01553f3c" facs="#m-edf2e81b-71f4-4d43-a6ea-cdc47065e1e0" label="lyrics-like">disti : haec autem lácrimis rigávit</l><l xml:id="m-c3317244-4b9e-470c-b57c-9d8e358ddeac" facs="#m-1d955503-6db4-4fd0-a868-252e8c43ad52" label="lyrics-like">guénti : et stans retro secus pedes</l><l xml:id="m-a66ab1c8-4f5d-4840-bdfc-20f4ce6a07e3" facs="#m-e641e8ae-d595-4b3e-b49e-3533737fa903" label="lyrics-like">ejus, lácrimis coepit rigâre pedes</l><l xml:id="m-170f447a-e7d9-4735-b8cf-8084c08b38a8" facs="#m-17183f5c-4001-4608-a407-a5b3a28dad2e" label="ambiguous">pedes meos, et capillis suis tersit.</l><l xml:id="m-71e1f47d-d777-49ef-bc7f-0ac8196d1679" facs="#m-fa978993-2920-46e2-8bbb-6061965649ae" label="lyrics-like">ejus, et capillis cápitis sui tergébat,</l><l xml:id="m-5b3a7180-779f-4d8c-bd26-0fa550217e68" facs="#m-b24ac96b-bcd0-4566-850d-3d0d370f78f6" label="lyrics-like">osculum mihi non dedísti : haec</l><l xml:id="m-0c2fb877-9454-475f-8168-0d0b9ec72940" facs="#m-26c3ce38-84c4-4b2e-9f36-9c9aa661aa6e" label="lyrics-like">autem, ex quo intrávit, non cessávit</l><l xml:id="m-c6f4a7d0-8b06-41fe-b58e-5ebfdf4fc020" facs="#m-c22d5817-0cdb-4cba-a653-09402ef28ed8" label="lyrics-like">et osculabátur pedes ejus, et un¬</l><l xml:id="m-9948506a-259c-4de4-808c-b998dfefbda0" facs="#m-7011e4e4-5c71-45e3-bba4-3c34fc5efbe8" label="lyrics-like">guénto ungébat. Videns autem pha¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a78619a-cfec-4a70-8510-1d584ea8c83f" facs="#m-06bd5f59-6a10-49da-93be-52b647725cd3" label="lyrics-like">osculári pẽdes meos. Oleo caput</l><l xml:id="m-0a7b9842-0b29-4a3a-aa1a-d63b0a89c413" facs="#m-c06d2aa8-63d8-4e00-a315-44e9d00ad876" label="lyrics-like">meum non unxísti: haec autem</l><l xml:id="m-dadc9088-2d55-49ac-9e47-bc3d1b3aed37" facs="#m-a38fc137-b72b-4296-9417-598483cb1ff3" label="lyrics-like">risaéus qui vocáverat eum, ait intra</l><l xml:id="m-c5d7a7e0-4808-430f-af68-5cd7c1b64305" facs="#m-b1223987-44ae-4e6e-b079-479f00820bf1" label="lyrics-like">se, dicens : Hic, si esset prophéta,</l><l xml:id="m-7c146593-71fa-4785-8f5d-ed9eca31491b" facs="#m-68f5479b-3712-46b3-8c36-3ac633407f03" label="lyrics-like">unguénto unxit pedes meos. Pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d0649be-1776-4524-b348-60a75cbed6a6" facs="#m-bdc51270-8799-4c5f-a70d-cf865669b968" label="lyrics-like">pter quod dico tibi: Remittúntur</l><l xml:id="m-bcba76c9-6acb-4161-b93d-7ea02ff668b2" facs="#m-bb2369a8-6391-4a4e-b42f-633a698ec8c9" label="lyrics-like">sciret útique, quae et qualis est</l><l xml:id="m-3f9ef122-ceb9-4555-b8db-219a3f67dcb1" facs="#m-6fc968d2-19c0-41c6-ba43-dc57b4a7efcf" label="lyrics-like">ei peccáta multa, quóniam diléxit</l><l xml:id="m-31e205f4-a5c7-4c70-9854-4cb3676621c5" facs="#m-1b8a6885-b942-477d-87b0-788f8cf04552" label="lyrics-like">múlier quae tangit eum: quia</l><l xml:id="m-8310550c-bb2e-48d8-9887-2fdbfa2bdc83" facs="#m-fa809ff6-a891-42a1-a2c0-bf0fc23cee86" label="lyrics-like">peccátrix est. Et respóndens Jesus,</l><l xml:id="m-2b4cf171-2d4e-4992-a121-c622214ba077" facs="#m-72443eb3-7c5e-4d05-b602-418aaab67292" label="ambiguous">multum. Cui autem minus dimitti¬</l><l xml:id="m-78a33fbb-ee6f-42f5-a3cd-102750aa0630" facs="#m-affdd509-48af-4356-b6e8-ebe01991d121" label="lyrics-like">dixit ad illum : Simon, hábeo tibi</l><l xml:id="m-5831c2bb-7a8c-45db-a1e2-0789edbe3f27" facs="#m-d52847ec-39e0-42d8-aa26-161805c8e5e4" label="ambiguous">tur, minus diligit. Dixit autem ad</l><l xml:id="m-16ec0dc6-cbcf-4ee9-990b-57e787b5c22e" facs="#m-fbc49677-f045-4b7e-abec-db809c0d5a7b" label="lyrics-like">áliquid dicere. At ille ait : Magister,</l><l xml:id="m-357bfd5e-1fe4-41b2-b98d-2b096779c5cd" facs="#m-4c438bc0-8cc5-4057-963b-15c699c10c03" label="lyrics-like">illam: Remittúntur tibi peccáta.</l><l xml:id="m-26f32e2a-32b9-4626-b16c-c14e7a84aecf" facs="#m-858a8b6f-b3e7-4fdd-b105-8e180f64f149" label="lyrics-like">dic. Duo debitóres erant cuidam</l><l xml:id="m-ed8b0125-3ec4-4c6e-8fb5-59c29828cb59" facs="#m-f646fbb0-add5-4f1e-b5a7-fb326f73517b" label="lyrics-like">Et coepérunt qui simul accumbé¬</l><l xml:id="m-91ea4c78-8d03-4853-a8e9-41f2b8446e4a" facs="#m-27f5c59a-4812-41ec-afe8-b82f95ba85ce" label="lyrics-like">foeneratóri : unus debébat denários</l><l xml:id="m-a8497787-c3f5-432f-af72-894b4fe2f663" facs="#m-a8cd0d08-83c4-4be7-8d68-305d120af804" label="ambiguous">bant, dicere intra se : Quis est hic,</l><l xml:id="m-9f7fa9eb-c5d6-4c52-b382-c5b41cf3d1e7" facs="#m-0ba9f26c-c80f-4450-84aa-7133db616236" label="lyrics-like">quingéntos, et álius quinquagínta.</l><l xml:id="m-3ff7adb7-b75c-46f9-bdd9-a3dd27c2ddd6" facs="#m-2ab602c0-26bd-4182-a2c8-535690319945" label="lyrics-like">qui étiam peccáta dimittit? Dixit</l><l xml:id="m-8a4cd763-4783-45c6-9b12-a38bfc3fe768" facs="#m-e8fed570-44f3-428a-9cd1-54bce065a668" label="lyrics-like">Non habéntibus illis unde rédde¬</l><l xml:id="m-39167c62-6302-4039-b920-c1ae347e7bc2" facs="#m-41a02e6f-72ac-48da-aed8-9e45d1626404" label="ambiguous">autem ad mulierem: Fides tua te</l><l xml:id="m-d2f29e0d-7faa-4b8e-94e1-6c4b1c8a17fa" facs="#m-c6f9cf81-c6c9-4c6a-9493-176f3fb78cdd" label="lyrics-like">rent, donávit utrisque. Quis ergol salvam fecit : vade in pace. Credo¬</l><l xml:id="m-909b4dda-115f-43e5-a207-399637797a95" facs="#m-58ab51b2-b7db-430e-8a62-017e47ca2fc0" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Filiae régum. p. 1228.</l><l xml:id="m-6edcf3af-fd5d-46cd-844a-7062e34c2cf8" facs="#m-7e584ad7-3fbf-4555-b63c-cf884ea23717" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-393d3e96-562f-40f4-86ef-d05f0180e187" facs="#m-95a397df-d5ac-4ff6-beb6-007d9607f486" label="lyrics-like">Unera nostra, quaésumus Dó-] quium unigénitus Filius tuus cle¬</l><l xml:id="m-11a1c9e9-c60b-42c4-b1d2-f73c5ef351f7" facs="#m-ccb9f1ca-d657-4189-8747-e1c80e87b934" label="lyrics-like">310 mine, beâtae Mariae Magda-Iménter suscépit impénsum:</l><l xml:id="m-1fe3e047-f10a-495d-8359-5193e8bef4c5" facs="#m-b7553450-6976-4919-b5af-52421c290688" label="lyrics-like">lénae gloriósa mérita tibi reddant ! tecum vivit.</l><l xml:id="m-db2058aa-abca-4689-ac43-2bf3a72b7349" facs="#m-c47e5814-3c8c-43b4-97e6-280b6533edde" label="lyrics-like">accépta cujus oblatiónis obsé¬</l><l xml:id="m-9e89696d-05f4-4ad2-ae52-cc5598e1408a" facs="#m-7606a3b8-7f7c-4420-beaf-e0176b329f09" label="lyrics-like">Communton. Féci judicium. p. 1224.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>